  "details": "A verification code is required when uploading avatar and logging in. Although it provides a certain degree of security, it also adds trouble. In the past, I helped my friends upload avatar and only needed to log in to their account in Unity to upload. But now every It becomes very inconvenient to have to ask them every time to get the verification code and wait for their reply before uploading.\n\nSo I hope to add a function that can customize whether to use the verification code function to log in to unity and vrchat, so as to reduce waste on unnecessary waiting.",
